Description: Live status of the Santiago Metro network (unofficial)
 Live status of the lines and stations of the Santiago Metro, network map and
 nearest station, with the local weather. Unofficial app, not affiliated with
 Metro S.A.; data is public from metro.cl. Interface in Spanish.
